# Where the retreat enquiry form sends its answers.
#
# Any backend that accepts a JSON POST works: Formspree, Getform, Basin,
# an n8n/Zapier/Make webhook, or your own API route.
#
# While this is empty the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client
# with the enquiry pre-written to executive@courtsidepadel.com, so no enquiry
# is lost — but set a real endpoint before launch.
PUBLIC_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=
